  "limits": "Rings are flat annuli with a round wire profile, tilted in alternating rows; the over and under is resolved per pixel by height, not by true 3D geometry, so deep overlaps and silhouettes are approximate. The gaps need alpha scissor. Contact shadows are darkened by hand rather than traced. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate, not ray traced.",
